    and brightness keys now go through it, so no keypress is silent.
  * Add missing click and scroll hints to every interactive Waybar module and
    wire scroll on volume and the power profile. Hovering a module raises its
    fill to #141920 and switches the 1.5px underline from #1c2229 to #b4f03a.
  * Lay out the flr-ctl, flr-mode, and flr-wall Fuzzel menus as two columns with
